 "text": "Hi, how's everything with you? Fill a clean water bottle every hour or so at the start, and refill from faucet as you go. A big jug can warm up. Keep it in a towel in your bag, and let it sit in the sun for a while before you drink. It worth trying. Fill the bottle at house cold water tap, and leave it in the sun for a few hours. Keep them in the sun as well, and let them open for few minutes every so often. A big blanket over them keeps the cold out.",
